  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "This Saturday, my son has a birthday party at two, and I promised my mum I'd visit her for lunch.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Busy. How far is your mum from the party?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "About half an hour.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then you could have an early lunch with her at twelve, leave at half one, and get to the party just in time.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My son needs to bring a present.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.29,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Wrap it on Friday night so you're not doing it in the car.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should my son",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "come to lunch with my mum too?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.98,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
